msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.plagiarism"
msgstr "Obtain the full similarity report and identify the extent and source of copied text|Assess: minor copying with poor attribution, or clear plagiarism of ideas or text|Contact the corresponding author with the evidence and ask for a written explanation|Assess the reply: if satisfactory or minor, ask for rewriting and proper attribution|If major plagiarism is confirmed, reject — or retract if already published|If needed, inform the author’s institution and the original author|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.duplicate"
msgstr "Obtain both publications and compare text, data and submission dates|Contact the author with the evidence and ask for an explanation|Contact the other journal’s editor to coordinate|If confirmed, reject; if published, issue a redundant-publication notice or retract|Inform the institution if the behaviour is repeated|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.authorship"
msgstr "Ask all authors for a signed statement agreeing to the author list and contributions|Hear all parties and request evidence of contribution|The journal does not adjudicate: refer to the institution(s) if no agreement|Pause processing until the dispute is resolved|Once agreed, amend the author list (publish a correction if already published)|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.fabrication"
msgstr "Gather evidence and consult an independent reviewer or expert|Contact the author with the concerns and request the original data|If unsatisfactory, contact the institution and request an investigation|If published, issue an expression of concern pending the investigation|If fabrication is confirmed, retract and inform relevant parties|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.reviewerMisconduct"
msgstr "Gather evidence (report, correspondence, overlap with the reviewer’s own work)|Contact the reviewer for an explanation|Remove the reviewer from the manuscript and re-review if needed|Inform the author as appropriate while keeping review confidential|If confirmed, remove from the reviewer pool and inform their institution if serious|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.coi"
msgstr "Identify the undisclosed interest and its potential influence|Contact the author and request full disclosure|Assess its impact on the findings and the review|Publish the disclosure (a correction if already published)|If it compromised the findings: expression of concern or retraction|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.citationManipulation"
msgstr "Analyse references: excessive self-citation, citations demanded by a reviewer/editor, or citation cartels|Contact the party concerned for an explanation|Remove unjustified citations before publication|If a reviewer or editor was involved, remove them from the process|Publish a correction if already published|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.paperMill"
msgstr "Record the indicators: template text, fabricated data, non-institutional email, similar submissions|Check other submissions by the same authors or with the same pattern|Contact the author for raw data and proof of affiliation|Pause or reject; if published, issue an expression of concern pending checks, then retract|Share information with other publishers per COPE/STM guidance|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.ethics"
msgstr "Identify the concern (no ethics approval, participant consent, data privacy)|Ask the author for the ethics approval documents|If approval is missing, contact the institution|Decide: reject, correct the ethics statement, or retract|Record the decision and close the case"

msgid "plugins.generic.integrityLog.steps.other"
msgstr "Gather information and evidence from the reporter|Contact the parties concerned and request a response|Consult the closest COPE flowchart|Decide and inform the parties|Record the decision and close the case"

